# Secrets — operator-local config + key material; canonical exclude pattern
# (also enforced at the csproj level via <None Remove> + <Content Remove>
# so a leaked file never rides into a `dotnet publish` bundle, mirroring
# trellis-trainer #41 / trellis-web #14 / trellis-server #56). Defense in
# depth: gitignore stops accidental commit; csproj stops publish leak.
appsettings.user.json
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
*.keystore
*.pfx
*.key
*.p12
